 'from collections import deque\ng = [[], [2, 3], [1], [1]]\ndist = [-1, 0, -1, -1]\nq = deque([1])\nu = q.popleft()  # 1\nfor v in g[u]:\n    dist[v] = dist[u] + 1\nprint(dist[1:])  # [0, 1, 1]',
